  "prefLabel": "Ph 706.01 Liability for Administrative Fines",
  "priorExpiration": "2013-03-26",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 706.01 Liability for Administrative Fines. Persons subject to the disciplinary authority of the board and other persons subject to administrative fines or penalties under RSA 318:29, IV shall, at the discretion of the board, after notice and an opportunity to be heard, be assessed fines and/or penalties as authorized under RSA 318:29, IV.\n\nSource. #2260, eff 1-5-83; ss by #2914, eff 11-27-84; ss by #4600, eff 8-1-89; ss by #6094-B, INTERIM, eff 9-21-95, EXPIRED, 1-19-96\n\nNew. #6181-B, eff 2-5-96, EXPIRED: 2-5-04\n\nNew. #8316, eff 3-26-05, EXPIRED: 3-26-13\n\nNew. #10903, eff 8-5-15; ss by #13398, eff 6-22-22 (formerly Ph 710.01) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ph 700)",
